## Commit Message Format
**See**: [Commit Message Format](shared/commit-message-format.md)

For healthcheck audit trail (read-only, no code changes):
```
chore: healthcheck audit - <scope> (<status>)

Mode: <quick|standard|full|deep>
Scope: <all|component-name>

Issues Found: <N> (<breakdown by severity>)
- Critical: <N>
- High: <N>
- Medium: <N>
- Low: <N>

Validation Results:
- Build: <Pass|Fail>
- Tests: <Pass|Fail>
- Code Quality: <Pass|Fail>
- Contracts: <Pass|Fail>

Recommendations: <See learning patterns or separate issue tracking>
```
